sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Agent as Agent (Web)
  participant UI as Vue/Inertia UI
  participant API as Laravel API
  participant Twilio as Twilio SMS
  participant DB as MySQL

  Agent->>UI: Compose message (content, target)
  UI->>API: POST /messages (content, target)
  API->>DB: Create Message
  API->>DB: Resolve recipients (groups/zone/all)
  loop For each recipient
    API->>Twilio: Send SMS
    Twilio-->>API: SID + queued status
    API->>DB: Create MessageRecipient (status=sent)
  end
  API-->>UI: 201 Created + progress summary

  Note over Twilio,API: Webhook callbacks for delivery updates
  Twilio-->>API: POST /webhooks/twilio (status update)
  API->>DB: Update MessageRecipient (delivered/failed)
  API->>DB: Recalculate message totals (cost, recipients)
  API-->>UI: Realtime/next fetch reflects updated stats



